# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Waitlist provider. Set ONE group. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in.
# With nothing set, dev writes signups to data/waitlist.local.json so you can
# test end-to-end.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Buttondown (simplest) ---
# BUTTONDOWN_API_KEY=

# --- ConvertKit ---
# CONVERTKIT_API_KEY=
# CONVERTKIT_FORM_ID=

# --- Mailchimp ---
# MAILCHIMP_API_KEY=
# MAILCHIMP_AUDIENCE_ID=
# MAILCHIMP_SERVER_PREFIX=us21   # the bit after the dash in your API key

# --- Or any generic webhook (Zapier / Make / Google Sheet proxy / your API) ---
# WAITLIST_WEBHOOK_URL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form. Providers are tried in this order: Resend, then a generic
# webhook. With nothing set, dev writes to data/contact.local.json.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Resend (emails the studio; recommended) ---
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_TO=hello@lookherestudio.in
# Until you verify lookherestudio.in in Resend, leave CONTACT_FROM unset (it
# defaults to onboarding@resend.dev, which only delivers to your Resend account
# email). After verifying the domain, set a branded sender:
# CONTACT_FROM=Look Here Studio <hello@lookherestudio.in>

# --- Or any generic webhook (Zapier / Make / Slack incoming webhook / your API) ---
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
